t into how we could run door at  scale across deutsche bank which we took  into the first full divisional roll out  this also showed the the need for an  option for their teams too small for the  full assessment which led us to develop  a facilitated quick check along with  train the trainer approach for scaling  delivery  we're really thankful to receive this  award from google and to all the teams  who've participated in the door  assessments across db and have really  helped to facilitate real  transformational change we're also  really thankful for our google partners  both on our account and with the google  door team as well

